# Code owners for corporate-site.
# Either the corporate or the development team can review PRs.
#
# Both teams are listed on ONE line on purpose: GitHub applies only the last
# matching rule, and a single line means an approving review from *either*
# team satisfies the code-owner requirement. Splitting them across two `*`
# lines would silently drop the first team; listing them as separate rules
# would require approval from both.
* @Satomic-Inc/corporate @Satomic-Inc/development
